      (psCode (WhereSigMultiClause ""))
      (psTemplate (WhereSigMultiClause ""))
      "绑定有多个子句，签名只能标注一个",
    PsEntry
      (psCode (WhereSigNoDef ""))
      (psTemplate (WhereSigNoDef ""))
      "绑定签名无对应定义",
    PsEntry
      (psCode ExpectedFixityLevel)
      (psTemplate ExpectedFixityLevel)
      "fixity 声明缺少优先级",
    PsEntry
      (psCode FixityLevelRange)
      (psTemplate FixityLevelRange)
      "fixity 优先级必须在 0 到 9 之间",
    PsEntry
      (psCode ConstraintUnsupportedHere)
      (psTemplate ConstraintUnsupportedHere)
      "trait 约束只支持在顶层签名与 trait 头上",
    PsEntry
      (psCode HandleClauseNeedsCtor)
      (psTemplate HandleClauseNeedsCtor)
      "handle 操作子句必须是构造子模式后接续延绑定",
    PsEntry
      (psCode HandleClauseNotIndented)
      (psTemplate HandleClauseNotIndented)
      "handle 子句缩进不足",
    PsEntry
      (psCode HandleNeedsOpClause)
      (psTemplate HandleNeedsOpClause)
      "handle 块至少需要一个操作子句",
    PsEntry
      (psCode HandleReturnMisplaced)
      (psTemplate HandleReturnMisplaced)
      "handle return 子句必须在最前且只出现一次",
    PsEntry
      (psCode (HandleContinuationNameMismatch "" ""))
      (psTemplate (HandleContinuationNameMismatch "" ""))
      "handle 各操作子句的续延绑定名必须一致",
    PsEntry
      (psCode (ClauseNotAdjacent ""))
      (psTemplate (ClauseNotAdjacent ""))
